{
  "$comment": [
    "FedRAMP 20x Key Security Indicator (KSI) catalog — Concord seed data.",
    "Families and indicator IDs follow the published FedRAMP 20x Phase One Key",
    "Security Indicators (KSI-CED/CMT/CNA/IAM/INR/MLA/PIY/RPL/SVC/TPR). Indicator",
    "wording is summarized and the NIST SP 800-53 / CMMC mappings and machine-",
    "readable validation rules are Concord's REPRESENTATIVE interpretation for",
    "automated evaluation. FedRAMP 20x is an evolving pilot; update this file (not",
    "business logic) and re-run `ccf fedramp20x seed-ksi` when FedRAMP publishes",
    "final machine-readable KSI definitions. This is not an official FedRAMP artifact.",
    "",
    "rule kinds evaluated by ccf.fedramp20x.validation: control_state, control_any,",
    "evidence_present, dependency_authorized, profile_field, connector_capture,",
    "any_of (best-of composite), manual."
  ],
